# The build context is the repository; the image needs the conda specs, the venv lock, the cmake
# wrapper and the sources the prefetch stage configures. Build outputs under cpp/ stay out.
*
!docker/conda/
!docker/cmake-wrapper.sh
!docker/venv.lock
!cpp/
cpp/build*/
cpp/install/
cpp/compile_commands.json
!flatbuffers/
!scripts/build.sh
